<title>UK: Asian Devt Bank sets 1.0 bln Ats five-year bond.</title>
<headline>Asian Devt Bank sets 1.0 bln Ats five-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Creditanstalt Investment Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ASIAN DEVELOPMENT BANK</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 BLN ATS   COUPON     8.25 PCT  MATURITY    23.OCT.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 SERIES B  ISS PRICE  100.25    PAY DATE    23.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  UNDISCL   REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	 =</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    VIENNA    PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 10	  SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
